This licence covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the data it
builds from, which stays under its own terms:

  * Route geometry and station positions are derived from OpenStreetMap and
    are therefore © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open
    Database Licence (ODbL). https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  * Timetables come from Transjakarta's published GTFS feed and from the
    public endpoints of KAI Commuter, MRT Jakarta, LRT Jakarta and LRT
    Jabodebek. They remain the property of those operators.
  * Camera positions and streams come from JakCCTV / Dinas Perhubungan DKI
    Jakarta, BPJT and Bina Marga, and remain theirs.

The dated snapshots under `data/snapshots/` are unmodified captures of those
sources, kept so that a build is reproducible offline.
